{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/139","id":4882390300,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUHbQ5s8AAAABIwNdHA","html_url":"https://github.com/gastownhall/bdp/pull/139","diff_url":"https://github.com/gastownhall/bdp/pull/139.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gastownhall/bdp/pull/139.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/issues/139","number":139,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement durable Transactional authorization revocation","user":{"login":"donnabox","id":520275,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDI3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520275?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox","html_url":"https://github.com/donnabox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Persist a private authorization-policy transition from all-visible, writable access to an empty view with mutations disabled. The transition drains admitted mutations within a bounded administrative deadline, publishes a new durable view, and revokes old stream delivery leases. Current reads and receipt pages project the new policy; old-view checkpoints, Snapshots, and continuations fail with their existing view errors.\n\nThe implementation preserves durable Event identity across policy changes and adds atomic migration/reopen handling. This is a Scope-wide private transition, not per-resource or per-principal ACL support. Public profile admission remains unchanged.\n\nValidation: static checks and 11 distinct source cases passed across the retained runs, including 22 HTTP exchanges, durable rollback/reopen, projected receipt schemas, HEAD behavior, stale handles, and queued-stream delivery. A coherent old-policy emitted control failed only its intended generation-and-lease assertion after seven requests. The clean integrated candidate also passed a fresh build. Fresh protocol/server archives and an external consumer passed both installed witnesses: 18 visibility/handle requests and four active-Event requests, with clean child/store shutdown. The initial observer attempt failed resolving AJV before any product child or HTTP; the external dependency anchor was corrected and that failure remains preserved. The initial full CI run found three stale fixture assumptions in two existing test files. The test-only repair preserves live reader capabilities and uses the current durable configuration fields; both complete files now pass all 114 tests, with typecheck and formatting passing. The failed CI run is retained; successor exact-head CI is required before merge.\n\nThe feature changes 17 files: the reviewed 15-file implementation and tests, plus these two compatibility fixture repairs. Production and installed payload bytes are unchanged by the repair.\n","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:06:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T02:35:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0d4de1793e9121c127e322637fb077db0057af5f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/139/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/139/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall